---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---
<BaseLayout title="HWcontrol Team" description="Security-first, local-first hardware software from HWcontrol Team.">
  <section class="hero">
    <div>
      <span class="eyebrow">HWcontrol Team</span>
      <h1>Hardware software, engineered properly.</h1>
      <p class="lead">Cross-platform hardware control with a security-first architecture, local-first data handling and production-oriented engineering.</p>
      <div class="actions">
        <a class="button primary" href={base + "projects/hwcontrol2/"}>Explore HWcontrol2.0</a>
        <a class="button" href="https://github.com/lordkeremello45/HWcontrol2.0">View source</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <span class="pill">Production architecture</span>
      <h2>Built around trust boundaries</h2>
      <p>Desktop UI, authenticated localhost bridge, native engine and platform hardware APIs remain separated so security and reliability can be tested independently.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="grid section">
    <article class="card"><span class="pill">Local-first</span><h2>Data stays local</h2><p>No intentional unnecessary telemetry, advertising or behavioral tracking.</p></article>
    <article class="card"><span class="pill">Secure CI/CD</span><h2>Supply-chain aware</h2><p>Dependency scanning, pinned Actions and reproducible build-oriented workflows.</p></article>
    <article class="card"><span class="pill">Open source</span><h2>Transparent engineering</h2><p>Public source, documentation, issue tracking and security guidance.</p></article>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
